@host = https://localhost:7132
@ownerToken = PASTE_OWNER_TOKEN
@customerToken = PASTE_CUSTOMER_TOKEN
@profileEtag = "PASTE_ETAG_FROM_PROFILE"

### 1. Login as Owner; copy token to ownerToken above
POST {{host}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"owner@morningbrew.test","password":"MorningBrew!2026"}

### 2. Current identity
GET {{host}}/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### 3. Customers; use next_page_token as pageToken to continue with the same q
GET {{host}}/v1/customers?pageSize=20&q=
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### 4. Shared products
GET {{host}}/v1/products?pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### 5. Shared variants and prices
GET {{host}}/v1/variants?pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### 6. Set shared price (Owner only). Select a real variant ID first.
PUT {{host}}/v1/variants/1/price
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"price":30000}

### 7. Login as Customer; copy token to customerToken above
POST {{host}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"lan@morningbrew.test","password":"MorningBrew!2026"}

### 8. Read profile; copy ETag header exactly (including quotes) to profileEtag
GET {{host}}/v1/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 9. Partial update. Read profile again before repeating this request.
PATCH {{host}}/v1/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
If-Match: {{profileEtag}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone":"0901234567"}

### 10. Voucher wallet
GET {{host}}/v1/me/wallet?pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 11. Validation example: pageSize out of range -> 400 error envelope
GET {{host}}/v1/customers?pageSize=101
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### 12. Logout customer -> 204; invalidates this token
POST {{host}}/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
